            "review_text": "Jennifer Le\nHouston, Texas2 contributions\n0\nBEST EXPERIENCE I’VE HAD 😍\nMar 2026 • Solo\nBình, Dương & Hiền are the most professional, friendly and acknowledgable staff there is in the Lounge. They’re all offering all kinds of insider info that usually we would keep gate like crazy for us Vietnamese. 10/10 recommend 😍💯\nWritten March 3, 2026\nCHICLAND Hotel Da Nang\nDear Valued Guest,\n\nThank you so much for sharing your amazing review. We are truly delighted to hear that you had one of the best experiences at Chicland Hotel.\n\nYour kind words about Bình, Dương, and Hiền mean a lot to us. We are very proud to have such professional, friendly, and knowledgeable team members in our Lounge. It is wonderful to know that their warm service and helpful insider tips made your experience even more enjoyable. Your compliments will certainly be shared with them and the entire team.\n\nThank you once again for your recommendation. We look forward to welcoming you back to Chicland Hotel for another memorable stay in the future.\n\nWarm regards,\nChicland Hotel Management Team\nRead more\nWritten March 16, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
