            "review_text": "Freedom56739157375\n1 contribution\n0\nIt was a great experience at Chicland Lounge; the design is airy and stylish.\nJan 2026 • Couples\nThe place has a beautiful atmosphere with an amazing rooftop view. I visited with my girlfriend and had a great experience thanks to the friendly and attentive staff, especially Binh, who took excellent care of us and was very quick and professional. I highly recommend making a reservation in advance so you can be served more smoothly.\nWritten January 4, 2026\nCHICLAND Hotel Da Nang\nDear Valued Guest,\n\nThank you very much for sharing your wonderful experience at Chicland Lounge. We are delighted to hear that you enjoyed the airy and stylish design, as well as the beautiful atmosphere and amazing rooftop view.\n\nIt is especially rewarding to know that you and your girlfriend had such a great time with us, and that our friendly and attentive service made your visit even more enjoyable. Your kind words about Binh will certainly be shared with him, and we are sure he will be very happy to know that his care and professionalism left such a positive impression.\n\nWe truly appreciate your recommendation and hope to have the pleasure of welcoming you back to Chicland Lounge again in the near future.\n\nWarm regards,\nChicland Hotel Management Team\nRead more\nWritten March 16, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
