            "review_text": "andytudor46\nPecatu, Indonesia70 contributions\n0\nDisappointed\nJun 2024 • Couples\nWe absolutely love this hotel, we love the restaurant ambience and view, the staff was great. The drinks were nice but the food was very expensive for what it is, we have been in Danang for 2 weeks and we paid £80 for 5 courses and drinks, which we shared between 2 and we left hungry, we have eaten at local Vietnamese restaurant with better food and bigger portions as so much cheaper. The chicken skewers were dry, the burger was ok. The shrimp didn’t taste fresh. Only 2 spring rolls which were ok. I would recommend an alternative restaurant for the price for sure.\nRead more\nWritten June 6, 2024",
