            "review_text": "Harry\nFlorida2 contributions\n0\nGood\nDec 2023 • Friends\nThe space is elegant, and the staff is very friendly. We had a really fun evening at the end of the year. Especially, we would like to thank Hong Duc for suggesting a great drink for us and Nhat Ha for being very lovely.\nWritten December 31, 2023\nChicland Hotel - Marcom\nDear Tourist15056677663,\n\nWe greatly appreciate you sharing your incredible experiences at Chicland Lounge on the rooftop, where the refreshing sea breeze fills the spacious and serene atmosphere.\nIt brings us immense joy to have contributed to creating unforgettable memories for you, whether it was through delightful dinners, exceptional wines, or intriguing cocktails. Your highly inspiring feedback roles as a great motivation for us to continually enhance our offerings.\nWe hope you enjoy your trip to Da Nang and look forward to welcoming you back to Chicland Lounge to provide you with an even more extraordinary experience.\n\nSincerely yours,\nChicland Lounge team.\nRead more\nWritten January 4, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
